        "id": 71486,
        "name": "Rabit",
        "username": "Rabit",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-28T19:07:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Nielzabub\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/48/1986_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Nielzabub:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Rabit, you kind of look similar to the imprisoned rogue in the block. You could probably pull that guy off without too much difficulty.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Heh…  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/sunglasses.png?v=12\" title=\":sunglasses:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sunglasses:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>I <em>seriously </em>thought about it, but it's not a very recognizable character in the multiverse.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>That's my story.</p>\n<p>Doesn't mean I won't show up in that costume some day.</p>",
