        "created_at": "2013-08-31T16:28:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"i am the plague rat\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n i am the plague rat:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Finally got around to seeing these. Good times, good times.I learned the hard way that fleese in August isn't a good idea. (I was the unhooded Spite) The rubber mask was also a bit sweaty. I took the mask off a few times before photos were taken</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah. You were literally dripping sweat out from the mask at one point. I felt sorry for you.</p>\n<p>Good \"realistic\" Spite, though.</p>",
