        "created_at": "2013-08-31T21:20:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"imprimis5\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/imprimis5/48/2387_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> imprimis5:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Yeah. You were literally dripping sweat out from the mask at one point. I felt sorry for you.Good \"realistic\" Spite, though.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Thank you. The first time I took the mask off, there was a small pool of sweat under the chin. I didn't mind wearing it from my hotel&nbsp;to the dealer hall though because I was making people on the elevators feel uneasy as well as a few people blocking an entranceway to the hall. And I didn't say anything… just stared at them.</p>",
